  "mechanism": {
    "description": "One separate, identically configured client launch whose ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL points at a loopback recorder started by the tool. The recorded request body is the exact model input the client built, so every active instruction source is enumerated from the client's own '# claudeMd' labels and proved byte-exact against the file on disk.",
